{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00003","headline":"幸蜀西至剑门 · 李隆基","name":"幸蜀西至剑门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"剑阁横云峻，銮舆出狩回。翠屏千仞合，丹嶂五丁开。 灌木萦旗转，仙云拂马来。乘时方在德，嗟尔勒铭才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李隆基","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/curated_00003.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00003","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于与开放语料未能唯一对齐，保留为整理本异文/组诗条目","citation":"吴汝煜 王庆生"}